{"lines": ["Three lighthouse keepers vanished, and one coat still hung on its peg.", "Flannan Isles, Scotland, December nineteen hundred. A passing ship sees no light.", "Eleven days pass before storms let the relief boat through. The gate is shut, the beds empty, the clock stopped.", "But upstairs, the lamp is cleaned, filled and ready to light.", "At the west landing, a rope box a hundred and ten feet above the sea is torn away, and the iron railings are twisted.", "Two keepers went down in their boots and storm gear. The third was meant to stay with the light.", "He went out in his shirt sleeves. Did one wave take all three, or did he run to save them, without his coat?"], "words": [["Three", 0.0, 0.16], ["lighthouse", 0.16, 0.52], ["keepers", 0.52, 1.16], ["vanished,", 1.16, 1.46], ["and", 1.46, 2.2], ["one", 2.2, 2.34], ["coat", 2.34, 2.66], ["still", 2.66, 3.08], ["hung", 3.08, 3.28], ["on", 3.28, 3.5], ["its", 3.5, 3.62], ["peg.", 3.62, 3.92], ["Flannan", 4.28, 4.622], ["Isles,", 4.622, 4.902], ["Scotland,", 5.162, 5.542], ["December", 5.802, 6.062], ["nineteen", 6.062, 6.361], ["hundred.", 6.361, 6.622], ["A", 6.982, 7.122], ["passing", 7.122, 7.522], ["ship", 7.522, 7.822], ["sees", 7.822, 8.102], ["no", 8.102, 8.442], ["light.", 8.442, 8.722], ["Eleven", 9.082, 9.244], ["days", 9.244, 9.604], ["pass", 9.604, 9.944], ["before", 9.944, 10.404], ["storms", 10.404, 10.704], ["let", 10.704, 11.184], ["the", 11.184, 11.284], ["relief", 11.284, 11.524], ["boat", 11.524, 11.804], ["through.", 11.804, 12.104], ["The", 12.464, 12.504], ["gate", 12.504, 12.704], ["is", 12.704, 12.944], ["shut,", 12.944, 13.224], ["the", 13.484, 13.584], ["beds", 13.584, 13.764], ["empty,", 13.764, 14.144], ["the", 14.404, 14.464], ["clock", 14.464, 14.644], ["stopped.", 14.644, 15.044], ["But", 15.404, 15.444], ["upstairs,", 15.444, 15.663], ["the", 15.923, 16.103], ["lamp", 16.103, 16.303], ["is", 16.303, 16.523], ["cleaned,", 16.523, 16.823], ["filled", 17.083, 17.183], ["and", 17.